    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529">

                <pb facs="0647" n="551" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg551"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Merry to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San José, Costa Rica</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February 15,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have received information rebellion in Nicaragua may be very serious. I have to
                    suggest your instructions to visit capital of Nicaragua the next steamer, Punta
                    Arenas, leaving the secretary of legation San José.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Merry.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
